    "text": "Strong winds about (40-50) kmph can be expected at times over Western slopes of the Central hills, North-central and Sabaragamuwa provinces and in Monaragala, Puttalam, Hambantota, Trincomalee and Mannar districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.0,
      12.0
    ]
